 ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只想有人真心盼着我 哦</span></p><p begin="1:21.760" end="1:24.330" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.760" end="1:21.860">I</span> <span begin="1:21.860" end="1:22.110">could</span> <span begin="1:22.110" end="1:22.400">use</span> <span begin="1:22.400" end="1:22.480">a</span> <span begin="1:22.480" end="1:22.770">lit</span><span begin="1:22.770" end="1:22.930">tle</span> <span begin="1:22.930" end="1:23.200">love</span> <span begin="1:23.200" end="1:23.670">some</span><span begin="1:23.670" end="1:24.330">times</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有时我也想得到一点爱</span></p><p begin="1:25.030" end="1:28.010" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.030" end="1:25.170">I</span> <span begin="1:25.170" end="1:25.450">just</span> <span begin="1:25.450" end="1:25.660">need</span> <span begin="1:25.660" end="1:25.780">to</span> <span begin="1:25.780" end="1:25.970">be</span> <span begin="1:25.970" end="1:26.250">need</span><span begin="1:26.250" end="1:26.740">ed</span> <span begin="1:27.490" end="1:28.010">Oh</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只盼有人也需要我 哦</span></p><p begin="1:28.180" end="1:30.840" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.180" end="1:28.480">Like</span> <span begin="1:28.480" end="1:28.600">to</span> <span begin="1:28.600" end="1:28.960">know</span> <span begin="1:28.960" end="1:29.120">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:29.120" end="1:29.280">cross</span><span begin="1:29.280" end="1:29.470">in&apos;</span> <span begin="1:29.470" end="1:29.900">some</span><span begin="1:29.900" end="1:30.350">one&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:30.350" end="1:30.840">mind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真想知道也有人会想起我</span></p><p begin="1:31.570" end="1:37.660" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.570" end="1:31.790">I</span> <span begin="1:31.790" end="1:32.060">just</span> <span begin="1:32.060" end="1:32.400">want</span> <span begin="1: